{"id":"21220e7f79386305","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-topological-inverse-direct-image-adjunction.md","title":"Theorem II.9 Inverse Image and Direct Image Adjunction","display":"Theorem II.9 Inverse Image and Direct Image Adjunction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-topological-inverse-direct-image-adjunction","aliases":["14-thm-topological-inverse-direct-image-adjunction"],"display":"Theorem II.9 Inverse Image and Direct Image Adjunction","depends_on":["[[14-df-topological-inverse-image]]","[[14-df-topological-direct-image]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","[[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]"],"source_location":"II.9 Theorem 2, printed 101–102; DjVu 56–57","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-topological-inverse-direct-image-adjunction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-topological-inverse-direct-image-adjunction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem II.9 Inverse Image and Direct Image Adjunction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db4fc8431db22e7a\" href=\"?note=db4fc8431db22e7a\" title=\"14-df-topological-inverse-image\">14-df-topological-inverse-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b12a36bd580ec12e\" href=\"?note=b12a36bd580ec12e\" title=\"14-df-topological-direct-image\">14-df-topological-direct-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b95e7093b0f57f47\" href=\"?note=b95e7093b0f57f47\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.9 Theorem 2, printed 101–102; DjVu 56–57"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)\">\\(f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)\\)</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu))\">\\(G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau))\">\\(F\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_{V,s}\">\\(t_{V,s}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*,f_*\">\\(f^*,f_*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"db4fc8431db22e7a\" href=\"?note=db4fc8431db22e7a\" title=\"14-df-topological-inverse-image\">14-df-topological-inverse-image</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b12a36bd580ec12e\" href=\"?note=b12a36bd580ec12e\" title=\"14-df-topological-direct-image\">14-df-topological-direct-image</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_F\">\\(\\eta_F\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b95e7093b0f57f47\" href=\"?note=b95e7093b0f57f47\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections</a>。分量公式的参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in\\nu\">\\(V\\in\\nu\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in G(V)\">\\(s\\in G(V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\tau\">\\(U\\in\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in(f^*G)(U)\">\\(t\\in(f^*G)(U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}\">\\(\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}\\)</span> 是层恢复同构分量的底层逆函数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{germ}\">\\(\\mathrm{germ}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_A\\)</span> 表示集合或函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的恒等映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:\\mathrm{Nat}_X(f^*G,F)\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Nat}_Y(G,f_*F),\\qquad\\Phi(\\alpha)_V(s)=\\alpha_{f^{-1}[V]}(t_{V,s}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi:\\mathrm{Nat}_X(f^*G,F)\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Nat}_Y(G,f_*F),\\qquad\\Phi(\\alpha)_V(s)=\\alpha_{f^{-1}[V]}(t_{V,s}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"k_\\beta:E_{f,G}\\to E_F,\\qquad k_\\beta(x,(f(x),[(V,s)]_{\\sim_{f(x)}}))=(x,[(f^{-1}[V],\\beta_V(s))]_{\\sim_x})\\quad(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_Y(G,f_*F)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[k_\\beta:E_{f,G}\\to E_F,\\qquad k_\\beta(x,(f(x),[(V,s)]_{\\sim_{f(x)}}))=(x,[(f^{-1}[V],\\beta_V(s))]_{\\sim_x})\\quad(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_Y(G,f_*F)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Psi:\\mathrm{Nat}_Y(G,f_*F)\\to\\mathrm{Nat}_X(f^*G,F),\\qquad\\Psi(\\beta)_U(t)=\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}(k_\\beta\\circ t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Psi:\\mathrm{Nat}_Y(G,f_*F)\\to\\mathrm{Nat}_X(f^*G,F),\\qquad\\Psi(\\beta)_U(t)=\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}(k_\\beta\\circ t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\\Phi=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Nat}_X(f^*G,F)},\\qquad\\Phi\\Psi=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Nat}_Y(G,f_*F)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Psi\\Phi=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Nat}_X(f^*G,F)},\\qquad\\Phi\\Psi=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Nat}_Y(G,f_*F)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>，右式的茎不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的代表：等茎在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 的某邻域上相等，自然性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 的截面在其逆像上相等。截面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 局部等于某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_{V,s}\">\\(t_{V,s}\\)</span> 的限制，因而右式局部来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的实际截面，并唯一拼接成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi(\\beta)_U(t)\">\\(\\Psi(\\beta)_U(t)\\)</span>。这些分量与限制相容。互逆性在生成截面上直接计算，再用局部生成及分离性扩展到任意截面。这既证明存在唯一性，也证明伴随双射对两层自然。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-topological-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"db4fc8431db22e7a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-inverse-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-direct-image","status":"resolved","id":"b12a36bd580ec12e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-direct-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections","status":"resolved","id":"b95e7093b0f57f47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-germs-and-stalks","status":"resolved","id":"46dda10bcd4e0ee1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"db4fc8431db22e7a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)$ 连续，$G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu))$、$F\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau))$。$t_{V,s}$、$f^*,f_*$ 见 [[14-df-topological-inverse-image]]、[[14-df-topological-direct-image]]，$\\eta_F$ 见 [[14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections]]。分量公式的参数为 $V\\in\\nu$、$s\\in G(V)$、$U\\in\\tau$、$t\\in(f^*G)(U)$；$\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}$ 是层恢复同构分量的底层逆函数。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-direct-image","status":"resolved","id":"b12a36bd580ec12e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)$ 连续，$G\\in\\operato